e3fbb5a08d9cccb54de94578fe.webm?t=1774667199\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/extras\/b03b5d050e0f7903b1ad8da5ea9c533a.webp?t=1774667199\" width=600 height=60 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中的大部分NPC都有好感度系统，你可以通过送礼切磋请教等交互方式，提高NPC友好度，并让他们成为你的队友来共闯江湖。每个不同的门派NPC有不同的江湖技能，若关系交好，他们还会将自身的神兵秘笈相送，助你称霸武林，在江湖上八面玲珑。 <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/extras\/4018d697fdeb31c948a4ec818c5eae1f.poster.avif?t=1774667199\" width=600 height=356 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/extras\/4018d697fdeb31c948a4ec818c5eae1f.webm?t=1774667199\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/extras\/fe0a347cfa00a3a444eb642783d84fdd.webp?t=1774667199\" width=600 height=60 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏内有近百张地图供玩家探索，关外、天山、中原等等……不同区域将有全然不同的天气与地貌。玩家可自由探索繁华城镇，山洞秘境，山寨据点等别具一格的丽景。 <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/extras\/964b0ba393579291c60488c80cd949ef.poster.avif?t=1774667199\" width=600 height=356 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/extras\/964b0ba393579291c60488c80cd949ef.webm?t=1774667199\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"《逸剑风云决》是一款像素武侠RPG。玩家将扮演一名来自关外辽城的普通少年，因意外卷入江湖纷争而身中剧毒，幸得武当掌门清虚真人出手才得救。自此，你梦想成为一代大侠，正式踏入了中原武林。你的选择将改变整个武林故事，与江湖中各种侠客结交互动，甚至改变他们的命运！","supported_languages":"简体中文, 英语, 繁体中文","reviews":"“Wandering Sword is an excellent debut game and has all the hallmarks of a classic RPG. Do not overlook this superb indie gem!”<br>9\/10 – RPGFan<br><br>“体验了《逸剑风云决》后，我真心希望它所呈现的老派武侠内容，可以永远年轻，永远少年。”<br>游研社<br><br>“What really impresses me about Wandering Sword is the way it blends old and new visual styles for an especially lush look.”<br>PC Gamer<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/ef32ad7a3d7bca74bd2d2d6b42c389491fd30493\/header_schinese.jpg?t=1774667199","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/86b333f68d9930a948d09d24cb0caad4966dca45\/capsule_231x87_schinese.jpg?t=1774667199","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1876890\/86b333f68d9930a948d09d24cb0caad4966dca45\/capsule_184x69_schinese.jpg?t=1774667199","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统 *:<\/strong> Windows® 7 SP1 \/ 8.1 \/ 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>处理器:<\/strong> AMD FX-4350 \/ Intel® Core™ i3-3210<br><\/li><li><strong>内存:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>显卡:<\/strong> [不支持集成显卡] AMD Radeon™ RX 560 (4GB VRAM) \/ NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1050 (4GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:<\/strong> 11<br><\/li><li><strong>存储空间:<\/strong> 需要 7 GB 可用空间<br><\/li><li><strong>声卡:<\/strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统 *:<\/strong> Windows® 7 SP1 \/ 8.1 \/ 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>处理器:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200 \/ Intel® Core™ i5-6400<br><\/li><li><strong>内存:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>显卡:<\/strong> Radeon™ RX 580(6GB VRAM) \/ NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 10